      "id": "claim_b78b504a28c0488c8d80b545cfc06ea0",
      "statement": "Talon selects durable history storage from DEEPAGENTS_TALON_HISTORY_URI, defaults to SQLite at the checkpoint path, supports SQLite, MongoDB, PostgreSQL, or exactly one entry-point plugin for another scheme, and namespaces its archive by assistant ID.",
